sequenceDiagram
    participant S as OutboxRelay
    participant MB as Bounded Mailbox
    participant A as Actor
    S->>MB: tell() — enqueue message
    alt mailbox has capacity
        MB->>A: deliver to actor event loop
        A->>S: Ok(())
        Note over S: limiter.on_success() — limit += 1
        S->>S: ack() message
    else mailbox full
        MB->>S: MailboxFull → DeliveryError::Capacity
        Note over S: limiter.on_rejection() — limit /= 2
        Note over S: nack(delay=backoff) → send_at = now + delay
        Note over S: message invisible until send_at expires
    end
